@startuml
title FoodLedger CI/CD 流程圖

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "開發者" as Developer

cloud "GitHub" as GitHub {
  component "Feature Branch" as Branch
  component "Pull Request" as PR
  component "GitHub Actions\nCI" as Actions
  component "master" as Master
}

node "本機 Jenkins" as JenkinsHost {
  component "Jenkins Pipeline" as Jenkins
}

node "Docker Desktop" as DockerHost {
  component "Docker Compose" as Compose
  component "FoodLedger API Container" as ApiContainer
  database "PostgreSQL Container" as DbContainer
}

Developer -right-> Branch : push
Branch -right-> PR : open PR
PR -down-> Actions : trigger
Actions -down-> Actions : dotnet restore
Actions -down-> Actions : dotnet build
Actions -down-> Actions : dotnet test
Actions -up-> PR : report checks

Developer -right-> Master : merge PR
Master -right-> Jenkins : Poll SCM\n每 2 分鐘檢查
Jenkins -down-> Jenkins : checkout / restore / build / test
Jenkins -right-> Compose : RUN_LOCAL_DEPLOY=true
Compose -down-> ApiContainer : build / up -d
Compose -down-> DbContainer : up -d

note right of Actions
GitHub Actions：
檢查 PR 品質，
不部署到本機。
end note

note right of Jenkins
Jenkins：
監聽 master 更新，
負責本機 Docker 部署。
end note

@enduml
